### Menus on the top bar (File, Help)

## File

menu-file = File
menu-file-new = New Design
menu-file-open = Open…
menu-file-recent = Recent Designs
# $path: location of the design file
menu-file-recent-pinned = [Pinned] { $path }
# $path: location of the design file
menu-file-recent-missing = { $path } (not found)
# $path: location of the design file
menu-file-recent-pinned-missing = [Pinned] { $path } (not found)
menu-file-recent-missing-tip = Not found. Right-click it on the Home screen to remove it from the list
menu-file-recent-clear = Clear List
menu-file-recent-clear-tip = Remove unpinned designs from the list (the files are not deleted)
menu-file-save = Save
menu-file-save-as = Save As…
menu-file-versions = Version History…
menu-file-versions-tip = Versions kept on every save. Open an earlier one, restore it as the latest, or name a milestone
menu-file-versions-disabled-tip = A version is kept each time you save
menu-file-properties = Design Properties…
menu-file-properties-tip = Part name, part number, revision, author and so on. The part name goes into the G-code header comment
menu-file-home = Home

## Help

menu-help-guide = Controls Guide
menu-help-guide-tip = Mouse and key controls, and the design and manufacture workflow
menu-help-search = Command Search…
menu-help-search-tip = Find a command by name and run it (S at the cursor, Ctrl+K at the top of the screen)
menu-help-crash = Crash Reports…
menu-help-crash-tip = View reports saved on this PC after a crash (nothing is sent anywhere)
